Adaptation 03-tdd-test-first

tdd writes the failing test first for every bug fix or feature, skips prototypes, spikes and pure
config, and names the check it used when no cheap test exists.

Fork source: https://github.com/mneves75/pstack-claude commits d13480d.
Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

